    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63967" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχ-ᾱγέω</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		 (borrowed by 
			Att.
		) for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχηγέω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead a</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχος</span> or <i>company</i> (commonly
			of <i><span class="en">
				100
			</span></i> men), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.1.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mem.</u>
				3.1.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				9.14
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχου λοχηγέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>consist of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχαγοί, -γοῦν ζυγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					10.13
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				11.1
			</span></i>.</div>
